              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "55aaf4d3-f7e3-4a3e-9196-01a6f7474f94"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Contributions to Philosophy</strong><br>\nAristotle made significant contributions to virtually every aspect of human knowledge, from logic to biology to ethics and politics. He is known for his empirical approach, which contrasted with Plato's idealism. Aristotle believed that knowledge could be obtained by interacting with physical objects and observing the natural world.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Aristotelian Method</strong><br>\nThe Aristotelian method was based on deductive reasoning, moving from the general to the specific. Aristotle also used inductive reasoning, drawing generalizations from observations. This combination of approaches allowed Aristotle to build a framework for scientific methodology that was used for centuries.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Works and Writings</strong><br>\nAristotle wrote extensively, and his works were categorized into logic, metaphysics, ethics, politics, and poetics, among others. Unfortunately, only about one-third of his original writings survive. They consist mainly of lecture notes for courses he taught and scholarly treatises. His texts on logic were collectively known as the \"Organon.\"</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
